# dh-sequence-gnome removed: package not available in Debian trixie main;
# dh_gnome_compile_schemas is reproduced manually in override_dh_install.
# dh-sequence-gir removed: the gir sequence is built into debhelper-compat (= 13);
# meson generates GIR itself via g-ir-scanner (libgirepository1.0-dev).
# libgnome-desktop-3-dev removed: pulls libgtk-3-dev and X11 (libxkbcommon-x11-dev),
# not referenced by upstream 1.8 meson.build.
# xauth, xvfb, mesa-vulkan-drivers, python3-gi removed: only needed for tests.
